This spell was used by [[Sophie Casterwill]] to repair a [[wikipedia:Shogi|Shogi]] tile, a vase, and after much concentration, to finally repair [[Eathon Lambert's journal]]. {{source|The Unseen Guide}}

In [[The Professor's castle]], Sophie used Findshape on a cracked area of floor to trap [[Behemoth]]'s foot. {{source|The Mission}}

In [[Peru]], Sophie used Findshape on the cracked [[Nexus]] to restore it, in order to contact [[Eathon Lambert]] with the powers of [[Januseea the Gatekeeper|Janusea the Gatekeeper]]. The fight with [[Mr. Wilder|Wilder]]'s suits outside made rocks fall on the Nexus, causing it to crack, and disrupt the connection. Sophie tried to use Findshape to fix it several times, but in the end, the Nexus cracked completely, terminating the connection with Eathon. {{Source|Doorway to Huntik}}

During the war against the [[Blood Spiral]], [[Nimue Casterwill]] used this spell to restore the cliff side to its original shape, thus removing the pathway to the [[Fortress of Iron Will]]. {{source|The Spiral War}}

